  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/P1120181.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">(19 fotos) A mediod&iacute;a de este domingo, 19 de julio, ha salido una expedici&oacute;n de unas 60 personas del Grupo Scout de Onda para pasar una semana de campamento en el Refugio Borja, de Vilallonga, en la comarca de la Safor. Regresan el domingo 26. Familiares y amistades les han despedido desde la avenida Luxemburgo.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentestiu15/p1120173.jpg\" alt=\"p1120173\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentestiu15/p1120174.jpg\" alt=\"p1120174\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentestiu15/p1120175.jpg\" alt=\"p1120175\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentestiu15/p1120176.jpg\" alt=\"p1120176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentestiu15/p1120177.jpg\" alt=\"p1120177\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentestiu15/p1120178.jpg\" alt=\"p1120178\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentestiu15/p1120181.jpg\" alt=\"p1120181\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidascoutcampamentestiu15/p1120183.jpg\" alt=\"p1120183\" style=\"max-w